# Espressif's kernel runs Linux on both cores (SMP) since its November 2026
# integration branch. Here it costs more than it gives: 336 kB of MemTotal,
# about 1 MB of MemAvailable and 0.4 MB of kernel in flash. On 16 MiB the
# board then has no memory margin left, and deployments fail
# (development_tools/results.md). One core, as before.
# CONFIG_SMP is not set
